# Cloudsculpt Technician: Flying; "As long as you control an artifact, this creature gets +1/+0." Bot1 pays for it with Black Lotus, which is
# sacrificed, so Bot1 controls no artifact: it is its printed 1/4. Bot2's Mox Pearl (an artifact the other side controls) does not count. On turn
# 3 Bot1's own Mox Jet makes it 2/4 (the toughness unchanged); on turn 4 Bot2 destroys the Mox Jet with Disenchant and it is 1/4 again.

